OL,3,APolanski banned from Israel after
OL,4,Aparty's motion declaring 'Zionism is
OL,5,Aracism'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's foreign ministry says it has
OL,8,Fbanned Green Party leader Zack Polanski
OL,9,Ffrom entering the country, after party
OL,10,Fmembers adopted a motion declaring
OL,11,FZionism a form of racism.
OL,13,FIsrael's foreign ministry described the
OL,14,Fmotion as a "clear antisemitic text"
OL,15,Fand beyond "the boundaries of
OL,16,Flegitimate political debate".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
